  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c9a2b427ce4ce710e8435edbdd7a183910d8b03a.png\" alt=\"battlescythe_revived_logo\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/77a50f24d1bad18e1d0b69d053d25fc765fb4130.png\" alt=\"space_blue\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>「ACG 戰鐮 - 復甦」是一款模組，旨在復原來自 Epic ACG Addon 的戰鐮招式組。</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/77a50f24d1bad18e1d0b69d053d25fc765fb4130.png\" alt=\"space_blue\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>本模組本身無法獨立運作，必須搭配資料包才能正常發揮功能！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>資料包範例：</strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/08325d97702cc0d601d1bd98b16c6793b33121c1.png\" alt=\"battlescythe_datapack_example\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3414c5657ade00d6149c0697cc76f0d2903bee86.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2044\" height=\"232\"><br><br><a href=\"url\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Epic Fight 模組</a><br><br><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">本模組未包含任何原創內容，所有歸屬皆屬於原版模組及其作者。強烈推薦您前往查看，以體驗更多內容！</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Epic ACG Addon： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-acgpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-acgpack</a><br><br></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b412707b37e196f163b9b93962b0924b8af64820.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"189\"><br></span></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>歡迎前往查看由我朋友製作的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod-rapier-moveset-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight Rapier Addon</a>，以獲取更多模型與內容！<br>也請支持由優秀團隊打造的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/ascendra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ascendra Modpack</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/horyzen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Horyzen Modpack</a>。</strong><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2bc05122fec4f505ec4c72474e54599c2f6bc3d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2047\" height=\"223\"><br></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝 EpicFight 團隊開發 EpicFight 模組。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝 dfdyz 開發 Epic ACG Addon。</p>",
